---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="BulkMagic — Seller Onboarding" includeCaseStudyScript>
<main id="main" class="max-w-page mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
      <!-- Hero -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center mb-20 md:mb-32">
        <div>
          <p class="type-eyebrow mb-5">BulkMagic · E-commerce marketplace</p>
          <h1 class="type-page-title max-w-[15ch] mb-5">
            Streamlining Seller Onboarding
          </h1>
          <p class="text-neutral-700 max-w-prose">
            Designing a personalized onboarding flow to reduce friction, improve compliance clarity,
            and help sellers complete onboarding with confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="group">
          <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: BulkMagic seller onboarding interface">
            <img
              src="/assets/bulkmagic/cover.png"
              alt="BulkMagic seller onboarding interface"
              class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
            />
            <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
              </svg>
              <span>Enlarge</span>
            </span>
          </button>
          <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <span class="caption-text">BulkMagic seller onboarding interface overview</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <!-- Overview -->
      <section class="max-w-page mb-20 md:mb-32">
        <h2 class="type-section-label mb-6">
          Overview
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-12 gap-y-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-neutral-500 mb-1">Time</span>
            3 days
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-neutral-500 mb-1">Team</span>
            Solo project
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-neutral-500 mb-1">Product</span>
            BulkMagic marketplace
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-neutral-500 mb-1">Focus</span>
            Seller onboarding, compliance UX
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric Stat Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-24 md:mt-40 mb-8">
          <div>
            <div class="type-metric-value text-black mb-2">3 Days</div>
            <div class="type-metric-label mb-1">Solo Design Sprint</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Rapid turnaround from compliance analysis to high-fidelity onboarding flow</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="type-metric-value text-accent mb-2">50 States</div>
            <div class="type-metric-label mb-1">Compliance Scope</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Dynamic nexus threshold validation & multi-state tax document checklist</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="type-metric-value text-black mb-2">5 Steps</div>
            <div class="type-metric-label mb-1">Progressive Flow</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Context-aware step progression replacing long, monolithic application forms</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-neutral-700">
          Online marketplaces face significant challenges when onboarding sellers. The process is
          often long, confusing, and filled with compliance requirements that vary by location —
          leading to frustration, drop-offs, and operational risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Problem -->
      <section class="max-w-content mb-20 md:mb-32">
        <h2 class="type-section-label mb-4">
          Problem
        </h2>

        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">Sellers struggled with:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          <li>Navigating lengthy, confusing onboarding processes</li>
          <li>Understanding which documents were required (W-9s, tax permits, licenses)</li>
          <li>Meeting federal and state compliance requirements across multiple states</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-neutral-700">
          For BulkMagic, incomplete or incorrect submissions increased manual review effort and
          introduced compliance risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Solution -->
      <section class="mb-20 md:mb-32">
        <div class="max-w-content mb-12 md:mb-16">
          <h2 class="type-section-label mb-4">
            Solution
          </h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-8">
            I designed a personalized, step-by-step onboarding flow that adapts to each seller’s
            business structure and location, reducing cognitive load and guiding them toward
            successful completion.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 1 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-20 mb-12 md:mb-20 items-center">
          <div class="max-w-md">
            <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Progressive disclosure</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">
              The onboarding begins by understanding the seller’s business structure and locations of
              operation. Only relevant fields and documents appear in later steps, preventing
              unnecessary complexity.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="group">
            <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: Progressive disclosure in seller onboarding flow">
              <img
                src="/assets/bulkmagic/progressive-disclosure.png"
                alt="Progressive disclosure in seller onboarding flow"
                class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
              />
              <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Enlarge</span>
              </span>
            </button>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <span class="caption-text">Step-by-step business structure identification</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-20 mb-12 md:mb-20 items-center">
          <div class="max-w-md md:order-2">
            <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Dynamic document checklists</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">
              A personalized checklist dynamically updates based on seller inputs, clearly
              communicating which documents are required at each stage.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="group md:order-1">
            <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: Dynamic document checklist adapting to seller inputs">
              <img
                src="/assets/bulkmagic/document-checklist.png"
                alt="Dynamic document checklist adapting to seller inputs"
                class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
              />
              <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Enlarge</span>
              </span>
            </button>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <span class="caption-text">Dynamic requirements checklist based on seller profile</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-20 mb-12 md:mb-20 items-center">
          <div class="max-w-md">
            <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Bulk upload hub</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">
              Sellers can upload multiple documents at once—such as W-9 forms, tax permits, and
              business licenses—reducing repetitive actions and errors.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="group">
            <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: Bulk document upload interface">
              <img
                src="/assets/bulkmagic/bulk-upload.png"
                alt="Bulk document upload interface"
                class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
              />
              <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Enlarge</span>
              </span>
            </button>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <span class="caption-text">Centralized batch file uploader for certificates & permits</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-20 mb-12 md:mb-20 items-center">
          <div class="max-w-md md:order-2">
            <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Automated validation</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">
              Real-time validation checks submissions against federal and state compliance
              requirements, including economic nexus thresholds.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="group md:order-1">
            <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: Real-time document validation and error handling">
              <img
                src="/assets/bulkmagic/validation.png"
                alt="Real-time document validation and error handling"
                class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
              />
              <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Enlarge</span>
              </span>
            </button>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <span class="caption-text">Instant error resolution & nexus compliance validation</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 5 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-20 items-center">
          <div class="max-w-md">
            <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Save & resume</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">
              Sellers can save their progress and return later, making long onboarding flows more
              forgiving and reducing abandonment.
            </p>
          </div>
          <figure class="group">
            <button type="button" class="lightbox-trigger relative block w-full overflow-hidden transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary text-left cursor-zoom-in" aria-label="Enlarge image: Save and resume onboarding progress">
              <img
                src="/assets/bulkmagic/save-resume.png"
                alt="Save and resume onboarding progress"
                class="w-full max-h-[80vh] h-auto transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.01]"
              />
              <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-sans opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none shadow-sm">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v6m3-3H7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Enlarge</span>
              </span>
            </button>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-500 flex flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
              <span class="caption-text">Persistent progress saving with multi-session continuity</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Product exploration -->
      <section class="mb-20 md:mb-32">
        <div class="max-w-content mb-10 md:mb-14">
          <p class="type-eyebrow mb-4">Beyond onboarding</p>
          <h2 class="type-section-title max-w-[18ch]">Taking a product from ambiguity to a campus pilot</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-neutral-700">
            Before the seller-onboarding work, I collaborated with the BulkMagic team as the product evolved through several directions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12">
          <figure class="overflow-hidden bg-[#071c28]">
            <img
              src="/assets/experience/bulkmagic-app-marketplace.jpg"
              alt="Desktop and mobile exploration of a progressive web app marketplace"
              class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption class="bg-[#071c28] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-white/75">Progressive web app marketplace concept</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="overflow-hidden bg-[#333]">
            <img
              src="/assets/experience/bulkmagic-group-buy.jpg"
              alt="Responsive BulkMagic group-buying product page concept"
              class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <figcaption class="bg-[#333] px-3 py-2 text-xs text-white/75">Group-buying e-commerce concept</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <ol class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 border-t border-neutral-300 pt-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10">
          <li>
            <span class="type-eyebrow mb-3 block">01 · PWA app store</span>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">The initial direction was a marketplace for progressive web apps.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="type-eyebrow mb-3 block">02 · Group buying</span>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">The concept evolved into an e-commerce marketplace built around buying together.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="type-eyebrow mb-3 block">03 · Campus pilot</span>
            <p class="text-neutral-700">The team piloted a food-subscription web app for subsidized coffee and other food with UHungry Cafe at the University of Utah.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="mt-10 max-w-content border-l-2 border-neutral-300 pl-5">
          <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">My contribution</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-700">
            I worked with product managers, engineers, and the head of product to define the product, map user flows, and build responsive prototypes. I surfaced ambiguity and facilitated conversations to clarify how ideas and edge cases should work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Key challenges addressed -->
      <section class="max-w-content mb-24">
        <h2 class="type-section-label mb-4">
          Key challenges addressed
        </h2>

        <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Complex compliance requirements</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          Sellers must comply with varying federal and state tax laws, including physical and
          economic nexus thresholds.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-6">
          <strong>Design response:</strong> Personalized checklists ensured sellers submitted only the
          documents relevant to their situation.
        </p>

        <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Seller frustration and drop-off</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          Long, unclear onboarding flows often lead to abandonment.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-6">
          <strong>Design response:</strong> Clear step-by-step progression, helper text, and bulk upload
          options reduced friction and cognitive load.
        </p>

        <h3 class="type-subheading mb-2">Document management and validation</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          Sellers struggled to track which documents were missing or incorrect.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-700">
          <strong>Design response:</strong> A unified upload hub with real-time validation and error
          handling ensured all required documents were collected correctly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Reflection -->
      <section class="max-w-content mb-24">
        <h2 class="type-section-label mb-4">
          Reflection
        </h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-700">
          This project reinforced how quickly onboarding complexity compounds in compliance-heavy
          systems. Small design decisions—such as when to ask for information and how clearly
          expectations are framed—can significantly impact completion rates and trust.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Project Navigation -->
      <section class="pt-8 mb-24">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch justify-between gap-6">
          <a href="/vitals" class="flex-1 py-4 transition group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary">
            <span class="block text-xs font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-2">← Previous Project</span>
            <h3 class="type-project-title group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors mb-1">Reducing Friction, Boosting Vitals Subscriptions</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Designing for trust and conversion in a sensitive medical ID product.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/alirtify" class="flex-1 py-4 transition group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary sm:text-right">
            <span class="block text-xs font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-2">Next Project →</span>
            <h3 class="type-project-title group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors mb-1">Designing a Data-Driven UX for News Validation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Translating qualitative research into ethical UX validation signals.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
